        <h2>Two Swedish Powerhouses</h2>

<details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
  <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">Is ZYN better than Nordic Spirit?</summary>
  <p style="margin-top: 12px;">ZYN and Nordic Spirit are very similar in quality, with ZYN winning on flavor variety and global availability, while Nordic Spirit appeals to users preferring a slightly smaller, more discreet pouch. ZYN has broader marketing reach and easier accessibility in most markets, whereas Nordic Spirit maintains a loyal following among Nordic users. Both are excellent premium options, so personal preference should guide your choice.</p>
</details>

<details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
