  <p style="margin-top: 12px;">ZYN offers more flavour options globally with 12–15 core flavours plus regional variants, while Nordic Spirit maintains a more focused lineup of 8–10 primary flavours. ZYN's broader portfolio appeals to experimental users, whereas Nordic Spirit's curated selection focuses on tested bestsellers. Availability varies by region, so check your local retailer for current options.</p>
</details>

<details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
